    {
      "source": "This class does <i>not</i> load the bean <code>Class</code> early.\nIt rather retrieves all relevant metadata from the \".class\" file itself,\nparsed with the ASM ClassReader. It is functionally equivalent to\n<a href=\"../../beans/factory/annotation/AnnotatedGenericBeanDefinition.html#%3Cinit%3E(org.springframework.core.type.AnnotationMetadata)\"><code>AnnotatedGenericBeanDefinition(AnnotationMetadata)</code></a>\nbut distinguishes by type beans that have been <em>scanned</em> vs those that have\nbeen otherwise registered or detected by other means.",
      "translation": "该类不会提前加载 `<code>Class</code>` 类型的 Bean。相反，它直接从 \".class\" 文件中检索所有相关元数据，该文件由 ASM ClassReader 解析。它在功能上等同于 <a href=\"../../beans/factory/annotation/AnnotatedGenericBeanDefinition.html#%3Cinit%3E(org.springframework.core.type.AnnotationMetadata)\"><code>AnnotatedGenericBeanDefinition(AnnotationMetadata)</code></a>，但区别在于类型：被扫描的 Bean 与通过其他方式注册或检测到的 Bean。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">Description copied from interface: <code><a href=\"../../beans/factory/annotation/AnnotatedBeanDefinition.html#getMetadata()\">AnnotatedBeanDefinition</a></code></span>",
      "translation": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">描述从接口复制：<code><a href=\"../../beans/factory/annotation/AnnotatedBeanDefinition.html#getMetadata()\">AnnotatedBeanDefinition</a></code></span>",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">Description copied from interface: <code><a href=\"../../beans/factory/annotation/AnnotatedBeanDefinition.html#getFactoryMethodMetadata()\">AnnotatedBeanDefinition</a></code></span>",
      "translation": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">描述从接口复制：<code><a href=\"../../beans/factory/annotation/AnnotatedBeanDefinition.html#getFactoryMethodMetadata()\">AnnotatedBeanDefinition</a></code></span>",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a new ScannedGenericBeanDefinition for the class that the\ngiven MetadataReader describes.",
      "translation": "为给定的 MetadataReader 所描述的类创建一个新的 ScannedGenericBeanDefinition。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Obtain metadata for this bean definition's factory method, if any.",
      "translation": "获取该 Bean 定义的工厂方法的元数据（如果有）。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Obtain the annotation metadata (as well as basic class metadata)\nfor this bean definition's bean class.",
      "translation": "获取此 Bean 定义的 Bean 类的注解元数据（以及基本类元数据）。",
      "count": 2
    },
